; Regression (2026-09-24): a match on a RECORD compares by content, case by
; case, so its scrutinee would be evaluated once per case; a computed one (a
; call) must be bound to a name first (Planner.plan_match#).
; xfail: error: a match on a value that is no number, character, flag or reference compares by content
function name_of(k: int) returns String
    String("x")

function f(k: int) returns int
{
    match name_of(k)
        case "x": return 1
    0
}

print("`f(1)`")
